35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The survey says daylight is the biggest complaint. The new joiners learned by listening.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Badge times are all over the place. Past shuffles took two weeks each.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We pay for empty desks. Moving costs 6,200 yen per desk.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,Setup takes up to nine minutes. Shuffles cause two weeks of chaos.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The printer side is nine decibels louder. Chairs take days to adjust.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, paying for empty space is painful. We need to use it well.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, nine minutes is a lot if we do it every day.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, if the chairs take days to settle, moving is expensive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, yes. The interruptions from shuffles are the real cost.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, the noise difference is significant. I need the quiet side.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"If we rotate, the joiners might not learn as well.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we fix desks, the early arrivals get the good spots.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Fixed desks mean we pay for the layout once, but it is rigid.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"Free address means no setup time, but no consistency.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Rotating blocks might mean I never get a settled chair.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I think we need a balance.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,We must be explicit about who gets what.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am leaning towards stability to save money.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I want to avoid the daily setup hassle.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I need a quiet, comfortable spot.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
